# Two power cycles (Review Focus 5): the second key-on starts from the EEPROM the first after-run wrote.
drive key-cycle
start blank
set coolant=90 oil=90 intake=33 ambient=20
3 on
1.5 crank rpm=200
10 idle
15 off              # the after-run writes the EEPROM and the main relay drops
3 on                # the next key-on: a new power cycle
1.5 crank rpm=200
10 idle
